vsm1.8:47.1:
No one who searches throughout the whole of this fathom-long carcass, starting upwards from the soles of the feet,
starting downwards from the top of the head, and starting from the skin all round, ever finds even the minutest atom at all
beautiful in it, such as a pearl, or a gem, or beryl, or aloes, or saffron, or camphor, or talcum powder;

vsm1.8:53.1:
Next, with the “brain pentad,” after saying “Bowels, entrails, gorge, dung, brain,” he should
repeat it backwards, “Brain, dung, gorge, entrails, bowels; lungs, spleen, midriff, liver, heart;
kidney, bone marrow, bones, sinews, flesh; skin, teeth, nails, body hairs, head hairs.”

vsm1.8:54.1:
Next, with the “fat sextad,” after saying “Bile, phlegm, pus, blood, sweat, fat,” he should repeat it backwards,
“Fat, sweat, blood, pus, phlegm, bile; brain, dung, gorge, entrails, bowels; lungs, spleen, midriff, liver, heart;
kidney, bone marrow, bones, sinews, flesh; skin, teeth, nails, body hairs, head hairs.”

vsm1.8:55.1:
Next, with the “urine sextad,” after saying “Tears, grease, spittle, snot, oil of the joints, urine,” he should repeat it backwards,
“Urine, oil of the joints, snot, spittle, grease, tears; fat, sweat, blood, pus, phlegm, bile; brain, dung, gorge, entrails, bowels;
lungs, spleen, midriff, liver, heart; kidney, bone marrow, bones, sinews, flesh; skin, teeth, nails, body hairs, head hairs.”
